Modifications (2026-11-12, fork v3):
- src/lib.rs: new listing_url() helper - WordPress 301-redirects /page/1/
  to the canonical URL and the 301 body is empty, so a page-1 request
  parsed to zero items and the homepage looked empty. Page 1 now requests
  the canonical URL directly ({WWW_URL}/, /newmanga/, /on-going/, /end/,
  /?s=...&post_type=wp-manga); page 2+ keeps the upstream /page/N/ shape.
  Canonical URLs verified live 2026-11-12: / (42 items), /newmanga/,
  /on-going/, /end/ (24 items), /?s=... (6 results).
- res/source.json: version 2 -> 3.
No other upstream file was changed.
